          "xuhongdi",
          "velazquezamalia",
          "ENDDREAM-ZM"
        ],
        "description": "Unreal Engine is Epic Games’ real-time 3D creation tool for games, film and visualization. Unreal Engine 4 and Unreal Engine 5 are distinct major versions; UE5 introduced Nanite virtualized geometry and Lumen dynamic global illumination. An Android library filename (such as libUE4.so or libUnreal.so) alone does not verify the engine version used by an app or establish that a rendering feature is enabled.",
        "source_link": "https://dev.epicgames.com/documentation/en-us/unreal-engine/unreal-engine-5.0-release-notes?application_version=5.0"
      }
    }
  ],
